---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Me"
  description="My background, methodology, and the technical tools I use to solve data problems."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About Me"
    title="Data-driven by design."
    subtitle="I combine statistical rigor with modern machine learning to build systems that don't just predict the future, but prescribe actionable solutions."
    compact
  />

  <section class="section aw-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="columns is-vcentered">
        <div class="column is-7">
          <h2 class="title is-2 mb-4">My Approach</h2>
          <div class="content">
            <p>
              My journey into Data Science is rooted in a strong mathematical and statistical foundation. I don't just import libraries and call <code>.fit()</code>; I focus on understanding the underlying data generating process and selecting the right tool for the specific business problem.
            </p>
            <p>
              I specialize in predictive modeling and prescriptive analytics. Whether it's estimating customer churn, modeling survival probabilities, or optimizing pricing strategies, my goal is always to translate complex mathematical outputs into clear, actionable business decisions.
            </p>
            <p>
              When I'm not tuning hyperparameters or engineering new features, I'm usually exploring new architectures in Deep Learning, staying up-to-date with LLMs, or building interactive dashboards to make data accessible to non-technical stakeholders.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-5">
          <div class="box aw-hero-box">
            <p class="aw-eyebrow mb-3">Quick Facts</p>
            <ul class="content">
              <li><strong>Focus:</strong> Machine Learning & Prescriptive Analytics</li>
              <li><strong>Background:</strong> Statistics & Data Science</li>
              <li><strong>Location:</strong> Spain</li>
              <li><strong>Languages:</strong> English, Spanish</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section aw-section aw-section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="aw-section-head">
        <p class="aw-eyebrow mb-2">Technical Arsenal</p>
        <h2 class="title is-2">Tools & Technologies</h2>
        <p class="subtitle is-6">The core stack I use to extract value from data.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="columns is-multiline">
        <div class="column is-4">
          <div class="box aw-card" style="height: 100%;">
            <h3 class="title is-5">Machine Learning</h3>
            <p>XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost, Random Forest, SVM, KNN, Ridge & Lasso Regression.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="column is-4">
          <div class="box aw-card" style="height: 100%;">
            <h3 class="title is-5">Deep Learning & AI</h3>
            <p>PyTorch, Keras, Optuna (Hyperparameter optimization), LLMs, Multilayer Perceptrons.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="column is-4">
          <div class="box aw-card" style="height: 100%;">
            <h3 class="title is-5">Data & Visualization</h3>
            <p>Pandas, NumPy, SQL, Seaborn, Matplotlib, Streamlit, Power BI.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="column is-4">
          <div class="box aw-card" style="height: 100%;">
            <h3 class="title is-5">Statistical Analysis</h3>
            <p>Survival Analysis (Lifelines), Hypothesis Testing, Feature Engineering, Advanced EDA.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="column is-4">
          <div class="box aw-card" style="height: 100%;">
            <h3 class="title is-5">Development & Eng</h3>
            <p>Python, R, Git/GitHub, Custom Scikit-Learn Transformers, Joblib.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>